#. i18n: file: kmail.kcfg.cmake:170
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (LegacyMangleFromToHeaders), group (Groupware)
#: rc.cpp:1477
msgid ""
"Microsoft Outlook has a number of shortcomings in its implementation of the "
